// Bandit Level 1 → Level 2

URL: https://overthewire.org/wargames/bandit/

Step1: Log in to the Bandit Level 1 server using SSH:

        ssh bandit1@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 2220

Step2: Enter the password obtained from Bandit Level 0.

Step3: List the files in the current directory:

        ls

Step4: A file named `-` is present.

Step5: Since `-` is commonly interpreted as standard input by Linux commands, use `./-` to explicitly specify the file:

        cat ./-

Step6: The output is the password required to log in to the next level, `bandit2`.

Step7: Use the obtained password to connect to the next level:

        ssh bandit2@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 2220

Step8: The Bandit Level 1 → Level 2 challenge is solved.

Step9: Congratulations!! you have solved this problem!!
